{
  "name": "AI Agent 工具：查询企业联系人与社媒资料",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 为 AI Agent 赋予查询企业联系方式的能力\n\n为 AI Agent 配置企业联系人查询工具，支持挖掘官网邮箱、国际规范电话及社媒链接。例如：*\"帮我查一下 acme.com 的联系人\"*。\n\n## 配置（仅需一次）\n\n**1. 获取 Apify Token** — https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations\n\n**2. 创建 n8n 凭据**\n凭据 → 新建 → **Header Auth**\n- 名称: `Apify API`\n- Header name: `Authorization`\n- Header value: `Bearer 你的_APIFY_TOKEN`\n\n所有 HTTP 节点均已配置指向该凭据，工作流文件中不包含任何密钥。\n\n## 计费说明\n\n按事件付费：成功找到联系方式（邮箱或电话）的域名每个 $0.006（Gold 阶梯低至 $0.003，千个起价 $3.00）。被拦截、无法访问或无联系信息的域名完全免费。\n\n当前价格详情：https://apify.com/sumitr_mardy/website-contact-finder/pricing\n\nActor 页面：https://apify.com/sumitr_mardy/website-contact-finder\n模板与开源仓库：https://github.com/sumitrmardy/website-contact-finder-api",
        "height": 800,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "t4-sticky",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -140,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "t4-chat",
      "name": "接收聊天消息时",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chatTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        340,
        60
      ],
      "webhookId": "contact-research-agent"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "你是一个销售线索挖掘助手。当用户询问某家公司的联系方式时，调用查询联系方式工具。清晰列出找到的所有邮箱、电话（带 E.164 格式规范）与社媒链接。若未找到联系人，说明该域名不可访问或未公开联系方式。"
        }
      },
      "id": "t4-agent",
      "name": "企业联系人调研 Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        600,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "t4-model",
      "name": "对话模型",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "toolDescription": "在网站或企业域名中查找联系信息（邮箱、电话、社媒链接、地址）。必须在 `domains` 数组中传递域名。",
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/sumitr_mardy~website-contact-finder/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"domains\": {domains}\n}",
        "placeholderDefinitions": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "domains",
              "description": "A JSON array of domains to crawl for contacts, e.g. [\"stripe.com\"].",
              "type": "json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "optimizeResponse": false
      },
      "id": "t4-tool",
      "name": "查询联系方式工具",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolHttpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        760,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "apify-api",
          "name": "Apify API"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
